  "title": "Wedding Planning Order Form",
  "subtitle": "Issue one controlled wedding execution order covering schedule, spaces, suppliers, service handoffs, revisions, and final operating approval.",
  "description": "An original wedding-planning order that converts approved decisions into a versioned operating record for venue teams and suppliers. It coordinates the ceremony and reception run of show, room transitions, responsibility handoffs, exception decisions, and day-of release.",
  "use_case": "Use after the planning request and commercial agreement are approved and the operating teams need a controlled execution record. Reissue the order for material changes; close it after final distribution, day-of release, and transfer of remaining exceptions to the event lead.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
